# The POT files are generated by bin/make-pot.sh. Collapse them in diffs and
# pull requests and mark them as generated.
#
# Do NOT add "merge=union" here. A union merge keeps both sides of every
# conflicting hunk, which leaves duplicate msgid entries and duplicate header
# lines. msgfmt rejects a POT like that and the freshness check still fails.
# Resolve a POT conflict by regenerating the file (bin/make-pot.sh).
languages/*.pot -diff linguist-generated
